    },
    "description": {
      "value": "_The Big Sky_ represents widespread change or liberation. As long as you have _The Big Sky_ invested, you gain a +2 item bonus to Perception checks made while you are flying outside during the day and to any check made to Escape. The bonus increases to +3 if you are at least 17th level.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nFor 10 minutes, you and up to four creatures you touch ignore difficult terrain and effects that would give a circumstance penalty to Speed. If you are at least 17th level, the targets also ignore greater difficult terrain."
    },
